{"uid":"sn1.55","title":"Gives Birth (1st)","reference":"Saṁyutta Nikāya 1.55","blocks":[{"kind":"verse","lines":["“What gives birth to a person?","What do they have that runs about?","What enters transmigration?","What’s their greatest fear?”","“Craving gives birth to a person.","Their mind is what runs about.","A sentient being enters transmigration.","Suffering is their greatest fear.”"]}]}
